        {
          "text": "Elyo bana ba-Israyeli bakaambila Musa kuti, Ncobeni tulafwa, tulanyonyooka, tulanyonyooka toonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.12",
